{"about_the_game":"The Circuit Breakers are back! Dive into the fast, chaotic twin-stick shooter built for pure arcade action. Battle through swarms of robots solo or with up to 6 players in local or online co-op, rack up high scores, unlock achievements, and bring your progress anywhere with cloud saves.<br><br>SUPER CIRCUIT BREAKERS delivers classic pick-up-and-play action with modern upgrades, including expanded display support, Steam Deck compatibility, Steam Input, and improved performance. Whether you're chasing leaderboard-worthy runs, teaming up with friends, or just looking to blow up thousands of bots, there\u2019s never been a better time to break some circuits.<br><br><strong>Jump into the action:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Up to 6-player local and online multiplayer<br></li><li> Cloud saves across your devices<br></li><li> Steam Workshop character skins<br></li><li> 4 free characters, plus a free weekly character rotation<br></li><li> Like seriously, this is one of 10 games on Steam that supports 6 players<br></li><li> Fully supported Controller, Mouse, or Mouse + Keyboard controls<br></li><li> A <i>jammin'</i> soundtrack<br></li><li> Free updates with extra content<br></li><li> A perfectly mesmerizing Attract Mode<br></li><li> Steam Deck mode, Steam Input support, and ultrawide compatibility</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"13faf7439a307fe48dfbb5293c0226c1a72ce823.jpg","localized_name":"Into The Depths","name":"Into The Depths","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1214540/13faf7439a307fe48dfbb5293c0226c1a72ce823.jpg"},{"icon":"b74ab3417e05f8c3b37d61b4e80760711194dfd2.jpg","localized_name":"Bax, Cracked","name":"Bax, Cracked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1214540/b74ab3417e05f8c3b37d61b4e80760711194dfd2.jpg"},{"icon":"44b03995aaaa28d02bbb3d92a41845c27d120dcd.jpg","localized_name":"Spikeball","name":"Spikeball","path":"https://cdn.akamai